        "original_id": "ed5bf1ff-8907-5144-a7a6-9c300c81858f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thomas Rickman, Sissy Spacek, Loretta Lynn, Tommy Lee Jones, Martha Plimpton\n- Works: Coal Miner's Daughter, Hooper, Tuesdays with Morrie, Truman, The River Rat\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, actress\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Actress\n\nFacts:\n- Thomas Rickman, sometimes credited as Tom Rickman, is an American film director and screenwriter.\n- Thomas Rickman is known for the films Coal Miner's Daughter, Hooper, Tuesdays with Morrie, and Truman.\n- Coal Miner's Daughter stars Sissy Spacek as Loretta Lynn.\n- Sissy Spacek won the Academy Award for Best Actress for her role as Loretta Lynn in Coal Miner's Daughter.\n- The River Rat is a 1984 independent family film directed by Thomas Rickman.\n- The River Rat stars Tommy Lee Jones and Martha Plimpton.",
